3 s\u0103n ch\u1eafc v\xe0 d\u1ebbo dai.',funFact:'B\u01a1i l\u1ed9i l\xe0 k\u1ef9 n\u0103ng sinh t\u1ed3n quan tr\u1ecdng b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 an to\xe0n cho b\xe9 d\u01b0\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc.'},{id:'tennis',english:'Tennis',ipa:'/\u02c8ten.\u026as/',vietnamese:'Qu\u1ea7n V\u1ee3t (Ten-n\xedt)',category:'sports',emoji:'\ud83c\udfbe',color:'#84CC16',exampleEn:'Hit the fuzzy yellow ball with a racket.',exampleVi:'\u0110\xe1nh qu\u1ea3 b\xf3ng n\u1ec9 v\xe0ng b\u1eb1ng chi\u1ebfc v\u1ee3t tennis.',funFact:'B\xf3ng tennis c\xf3 l\u1edbp n\u1ec9 x\xf9 \u0111\u1ec3 ki\u1ec3m so\xe1t qu\u1ef9 \u0111\u1ea1o bay \u1ed5n \u0111\u1ecbnh.'},{id:'volleyball',english:'Volleyball',ipa:'/\u02c8v\u0251\u02d0.li.b\u0251\u02d0l/',vietnamese:'B\xf3ng Chuy\u1ec1n',category:'sports',emoji:'\ud83c\udfd0',color:'#38BDF8',exampleEn:'Spike the ball over the high net.',exampleVi:'\u0110\u1eadp b\xf3ng uy l\u1ef1c bay qua chi\u1ebfc l\u01b0\u1edbi cao.',funFact:'B\xf3ng chuy\u1ec1n b\xe3i bi\u1ec3n l\xe0 m\xf4n th\u1ec3 thao m\xf9a h\xe8 v\xf4 c\xf9ng s\xf4i \u0111\u1ed9ng.'},{id:'cycling',english:'Cycling',ipa:'/\u02c8sa\u026a.kl\u026a\u014b/',vietnamese:'\u0110\u1ea1p Xe Th\u1ec3 Thao',category:'sports',emoji:'\ud83d\udeb4',color:'#16A34A',exampleEn:'Cycling in the morning refreshes your mind.',exampleVi:'\u0110\u1ea1p xe bu\u1ed5i s\xe1ng gi\xfap tinh th\u1ea7n s\u1ea3ng kho\xe1i tr\xe0n \u0111\u1ea7y n\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3ng.',funFact:'\u0110\u1ea1p xe gi\xfap t\u0103ng c\u01b0\u1eddng s\u1ee9c kh\u1ecfe tim m\u1ea1ch v\xe0 s\u1ee9c b\u1ec1n \u0111\xf4i ch\xe2n.'},{id:'running',english:'Running',ipa:'/\u02c8r\u028cn.\u026a\u014b/',vietnamese:'Ch\u1ea1y B\u1ed9 Th\u1ec3 D\u1ee5c',category:'sports',emoji:'\ud83c\udfc3',color:'#DC2626',exampleEn:'Running every day keeps you healthy.',exampleVi:'Ch\u1ea1y b\u1ed9 m\u1ed7i ng\xe0y gi\xfap b\xe9 lu\xf4n kh\u1ecfe kho\u1eafn.',funFact:'Ch\u1ea1y b\u1ed9 k\xedch th\xedch ti\u1ebft endorphin gi\xfap b\xe9 lu\xf4n vui v\u1ebb v\xe0 l\u1ea1c quan.'},