\xf3 th\u1ec3 s\u1ed1ng r\u1ea5t l\xe2u v\xe0 kh\xf4ng ng\u1eebng l\u1edbn l\xean trong su\u1ed1t cu\u1ed9c \u0111\u1eddi.'},{id:'squid',english:'Squid',ipa:'/skw\u026ad/',vietnamese:'Con M\u1ef1c',category:'sea_creatures',emoji:'\ud83e\udd91',color:'#FB7185',exampleEn:'The squid shoots dark ink to escape danger.',exampleVi:'Con m\u1ef1c phun ra \u0111\xe1m m\u1ef1c \u0111en nh\xe1nh \u0111\u1ec3 tr\u1ed1n tho\xe1t k\u1ebb th\xf9.',funFact:'M\u1ef1c \u1ed1ng c\xf3 \u0111\xf4i m\u1eaft to gi\xfap nh\xecn r\xf5 con m\u1ed3i d\u01b0\u1edbi \u0111\xe1y bi\u1ec3n s\xe2u th\u1eb3m.'},{id:'coral',english:'Coral',ipa:'/\u02c8k\u0254\u02d0r.\u0259l/',vietnamese:'San H\xf4',category:'sea_creatures',emoji:'\ud83e\udeb8',color:'#FB923C',exampleEn:'Vibrant coral reefs are home to millions of fish.',exampleVi:'Nh\u1eefng r\u1ea1n san h\xf4 r\u1ef1c r\u1ee1 l\xe0 t\u1ed5 \u1ea5m c\u1ee7a h\xe0ng tri\u1ec7u sinh v\u1eadt bi\u1ec3n.',funFact:'San h\xf4 th\u1ef1c ch\u1ea5t l\xe0 nh\u1eefng sinh v\u1eadt \u0111\u1ed9ng v\u1eadt nh\u1ecf b\xe9 s\u1ed1ng th\xe0nh qu\u1ea7n th\u1ec3 kh\u1ed5ng l\u1ed3.'},{id:'seal',english:'Seal',ipa:'/si\u02d0l/',vietnamese:'H\u1ea3i C\u1ea9u (Ch\xf3 Bi\u1ec3n)',category:'sea_creatures',emoji:'\ud83e\uddad',color:'#64748B',exampleEn:'The playful seal claps its flippers on ice.',exampleVi:'Ch\xfa h\u1ea3i c\u1ea9u tinh ngh\u1ecbch v\u1ed7 \u0111\xf4i v\xe2y tr\xean t\u1ea3ng b\u0103ng tr\u1eafng.',funFact:'H\u1ea3i c\u1ea9u c\xf3 l\u1edbp m\u1ee1 d\xe0y d\u01b0\u1edbi da gi\xfap gi\u1eef \u1ea5m c\u01a1 th\u1ec3 trong l\xe0n n\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\xf3ng b\u0103ng.'},{id:'walrus',english:'Walrus',ipa:'/\u02c8w\u0251\u02d0l.r\u0259s/',vietnamese:'H\u1ea3i M\xe3',category:'sea_creatures',emoji:'\ud83e\uddad',color:'#78350F',exampleEn:'The giant walrus has two long ivory tusks.',exampleVi:'H\u1ea3i m\xe3 kh\u1ed5ng l\u1ed3 c\xf3 hai chi\u1ebfc ng\xe0 d\xe0i b\u1eb1ng ng\xe0 voi.',funFact:'H\u1ea3i m\xe3 d\xf9ng c\u1eb7p ng\xe0 d\xe0i \u0111\u1ec3 k\xe9o c\u01