 sunshine into clean energy.',exampleVi:'T\u1ea5m pin m\u1eb7t tr\u1eddi bi\u1ebfn \xe1nh n\u1eafng th\xe0nh ngu\u1ed3n n\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3ng s\u1ea1ch.',funFact:'N\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3ng kh\xf4ng t\u1ef1 nhi\xean sinh ra hay m\u1ea5t \u0111i m\xe0 ch\u1ec9 chuy\u1ec3n h\xf3a t\u1eeb d\u1ea1ng n\xe0y sang d\u1ea1ng kh\xe1c.'},{id:'telescope',english:'Telescope',ipa:'/\u02c8tel.\u0259.sko\u028ap/',vietnamese:'K\xednh Thi\xean V\u0103n',category:'science_wonders',emoji:'\ud83d\udd2d',color:'#3B82F6',exampleEn:'Look at craters on the Moon through a telescope.',exampleVi:'Ng\u1eafm nh\xecn c\xe1c mi\u1ec7ng h\u1ed1 tr\xean M\u1eb7t tr\u0103ng qua k\xednh thi\xean v\u0103n.',funFact:'K\xednh thi\xean v\u0103n kh\xf4ng gian Hubble ch\u1ee5p \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c nh\u1eefng b\u1ee9c \u1ea3nh tuy\u1ec7t \u0111\u1eb9p v\u1ec1 c\xe1c thi\xean h\xe0 xa x\xf4i.'},{id:'microscope',english:'Microscope',ipa:'/\u02c8ma\u026a.kr\u0259.sko\u028ap/',vietnamese:'K\xednh Hi\u1ec3n Vi',category:'science_wonders',emoji:'\ud83d\udd2c',color:'#8B5CF6',exampleEn:'Discover tiny cells through the powerful microscope.',exampleVi:'Kh\xe1m ph\xe1 nh\u1eefng t\u1ebf b\xe0o t\xed hon qua chi\u1ebfc k\xednh hi\u1ec3n vi hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i.',funFact:'K\xednh hi\u1ec3n vi c\xf3 th\u1ec3 ph\xf3ng \u0111\u1ea1i h\xecnh \u1ea3nh l\xean h\xe0ng tri\u1ec7u l\u1ea7n gi\xfap nh\xecn r\xf5 t\u1eebng con vi khu\u1ea9n.'},{id:'fossil',english:'Fossil',ipa:'/\u02c8f\u0251\u02d0.s\u0259l/',vietnamese:'H\xf3a Th\u1ea1ch',category:'science_wonders',emoji:'\ud83e\uddb4',color:'#92400E',exampleEn:'Dinosaur footprints preserved in ancient rock fossils.',exampleVi:'D\u1ea5u ch\xe2n kh\u1ee7ng long \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u01b0u gi\u1eef trong nh\u1eefng t\u1ea3ng \u0111\xe1 h\xf3a th\u1ea1ch c\u1ed5 x\u01b0a.',funFact:'H\xf3a th\u1ea1ch l\xe0 nh\u1eefng d\u1ea5u t\xedch c\u1ee7a sinh v\u1eadt s\u1ed1ng t\u1eeb h\xe0ng tri\u1ec7u n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1ec3 l\u1ea1i.'},{id:'galaxy',english:'Galaxy',ipa:'